const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文讨论在多次尝试、非正态收益与回测选择偏差存在时，如何重新理解Sharpe ratio的显著性。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"“The Deflated Sharpe Ratio: Correcting for Selection Bias, Backtest Overfitting, and Non-Normality” frames a bounded research question. Read the stated question together with the named sample, dates, and institutional setting rather than treating it as a conclusion that automatically travels to another market or period."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.3905/jpm.2014.40.5.094",label:{zh:"The Journal of Portfolio Management (2014) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Portfolio Management (2014) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"方法把观测到的Sharpe ratio放在候选策略数量、收益分布形状与样本长度共同构成的检验背景中。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"For “The Deflated Sharpe Ratio: Correcting for Selection Bias, Backtest Overfitting, and Non-Normality”, the source describes a deliberate comparison, observation window, and control relation. Those choices are part of its research contract: changing one can change the proposition being tested, even when the method label remains the same."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.3905/jpm.2014.40.5.094",label:{zh:"The Journal of Portfolio Management (2014) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Portfolio Management (2014) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要留存完整候选池、每次试验的选择过程、收益频率、偏度、峰度与样本长度，而非只保存胜出的曲线。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"For “The Deflated Sharpe Ratio: Correcting for Selection Bias, Backtest Overfitting, and Non-Normality”, keep the fields, their availability timing, and the sample filters separate from the original study. A same-named variable, later-revised database, or matching end-of-period date is not automatically a comparable input."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.3905/jpm.2014.40.5.094",label:{zh:"The Journal of Portfolio Management (2014) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Portfolio Management (2014) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"修正的目标是降低从大量尝试中挑出高指标所造成的乐观解释，不是把一个阈值变成自动有效的策略认证。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"For “The Deflated Sharpe Ratio: Correcting for Selection Bias, Backtest Overfitting, and Non-Normality”, the source supports only the empirical or theoretical relation it describes. It does not turn association, model fit, or historical performance into causality, a directly executable procedure, or a guarantee about subsequent outcomes."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.3905/jpm.2014.40.5.094",label:{zh:"The Journal of Portfolio Management (2014) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Portfolio Management (2014) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"登记全部试验而非只登记最终模型，确认独立性假设与年化口径，并保持训练、验证和测试样本隔离。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Before extending “The Deflated Sharpe Ratio: Correcting for Selection Bias, Backtest Overfitting, and Non-Normality”, record its sample, timing, construction choices, and source edition in a versioned note. Keep the primary-source link and access date so a later reader can distinguish a changed definition from a changed result."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.3905/jpm.2014.40.5.094",label:{zh:"The Journal of Portfolio Management (2014) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Portfolio Management (2014) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Journal of Portfolio Management (2014)。统计修正不能替代真实交易摩擦、数据修订风险或未来分布变化的评估。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Journal of Portfolio Management (2014) for “The Deflated Sharpe Ratio: Correcting for Selection Bias, Backtest Overfitting, and Non-Normality”. Its public description defines the boundary. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.3905/jpm.2014.40.5.094",label:{zh:"The Journal of Portfolio Management (2014) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Portfolio Management (2014) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“The Deflated Sharpe Ratio: Correcting for Selection Bias, Backtest Overfitting, and Non-Normality”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。统计修正不能替代真实交易摩擦、数据修订风险或未来分布变化的评估。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “The Deflated Sharpe Ratio: Correcting for Selection Bias, Backtest Overfitting, and Non-Normality”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
